{
  "title": { "zh": "带上校验字节", "en": "Send the check byte" },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "像塞一个 0 那样把交来的每一帧送出，只是内容后面多跟一个校验字节：5 个 0，再加内容的 3 位校验码，和内容一起做位填充。只在「发送」为 1 时开始新的一帧。「下一个」取走队首，「末字节」标出帧尾。",
    "en": "Send each frame handed to you as in slipping in a 0, except that its content is followed by a check byte: five 0s, then the content's 3 check bits, stuffed along with the content. Start a new frame only while send is 1. Next takes the byte in front; last marks a frame's final byte."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref>能停一拍了。一帧有几个字节事先不知道，校验码就放在整帧内容后面：前面补 5 个 0，凑成一个校验字节。收的一方拿它核对整帧，这是<wiki-ref to=\"error-detection\"></wiki-ref>；这一关先做发的一方。",
        "en": "<part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref> can stand still for a tick now. A frame's length is not known in advance, so its check goes after the whole content, with five 0s in front to make a check byte. The receiver checks the whole frame by it: this is <wiki-ref to=\"error-detection\"></wiki-ref>. This level builds the sending end."
      }
    }
  ],
  "hint": [
    {
      "zh": "<part-ref to=\"framer\"></part-ref>只送交给它的字节：校验字节要在最后一个内容字节之后交给它。",
      "en": "<part-ref to=\"framer\"></part-ref> sends only the bytes it is given: the check byte has to be given to it after the last content byte."
    },
    {
      "zh": "<part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref>要收的是内容字节本身的位，不是线上带着旗标和填充的位。",
      "en": "<part-ref to=\"crchold\"></part-ref> must take in the bits of the content bytes, not the wire's bits with flags and stuffing."
    },
    { "zh": "每一帧的校验码只算这一帧的内容。", "en": "Each frame's check covers that frame's content only." }
  ],
  "inputs": [
    { "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "队首", "en": "Next byte" } },
    { "name": "last", "label": { "zh": "末字节", "en": "Last byte" } },
    { "name": "send", "label": { "zh": "发送", "en": "Send" } }
  ],
  "outputs": [{ "name": "next", "label": { "zh": "下一个", "en": "Next" } }],
  "pulls": { "input": "byte", "next": "next", "last": "last" },
  "wires": { "out": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "出线", "en": "Wire out" } }] },
